        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Boards are very dangerous, and ice is not up to standard. Referees in CHL are the worst you will ever come across. Good luck playing here. I advise to put your child as absent for game",
        "time": 1763954490,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Wagner Carvalho",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102826658514194503412/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXYmhULsl9t5Lf7N0hTB_Nh2SA0B7IhOwt-6i9kS8fp5pR6Jx-s=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "It is about time the cities in Ile Perrot have a proper sport center with arenas and place for other activities. Cite des jeunes unfortunately do not meet the demand. The place served the community well for decades, but definitely time for something more.\nThe parking is ok, and the cafeteria is ok also...but internal space and rink need full replacement.",
        "time": 1757708815,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jeff Lowe",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107391519065536085558/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLGU63_yhamY2Np0CIHjdQBFjSOnQWIskIJUEfkpoaUvbfvjQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Does its job for hockey.Arena is a older facility with low seating near the ice and very small lobby that can get crowded. Snack bar is present with beer sales available. Great ice surface for playing. Average parking .",
        "time": 1554299964,
        "translated": false
      },
